#: ../../source/reference/rigidbody.rst:13
msgid ""
"The RigidBody class provides a flexible interface for managing dynamic "
"rigid bodies in a physics simulation. It supports mass, kinematic "
"properties, locking of positions and rotations, and synchronization with "
"custom collider components."
msgstr ""

